<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Faysal Bank H1 net up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Faysal Bank H1 net up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Income		     1,348 vs 927</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     323 vs 286</p>
<p>    After-tax profit	   158 vs 131</p>
<p>    Interim dividend	   nil vs nil</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Faysal Commercial Bank Ltd. Bank's year ends in December.</p>
<p>($1=40.62 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
